        "timing_status": "full",
        "timed_units": 23,
        "untimed_units": 0,
        "text": "这并不是告别，这是一个篇章的结束，也是新篇章的开始。"
      },
      {
        "id": "utt-0001",
        "speaker": "SPK_00",
        "start": null,
