        "timing_status": "failed",
        "timed_units": 0,
        "untimed_units": 21,
        "text": "钙、钾等元素属于金属，银和金等元素当然也是金属。"
      },
      {
        "id": "utt-0002",
        "speaker": "SPK_01",
        "start": 22.61,
        "end": 27.041,
        "timing_status": "partial",
        "timed_units": 20,
        "untimed_units": 2,
        "text": "脚下垂直劲空十五米，该项目于二零一一年八月完工，"
      },
      {
        "id": "utt-0003",
        "speaker": "SPK_01",
        "start": 27.985,
        "end": 30.915,
        "timing_status": "full",
        "timed_units": 15,
        "untimed_units": 0,
        "text": "但直到二零一七年三月才开始通车"
      },
      {
        "id": "utt-0004",
        "speaker": "SPK_01",
        "start": 36.64,
        "end": 43.009,
        "timing_status": "full",
        "timed_units": 31,
        "untimed_units": 0,
        "text": "科学家们可以得出结论 暗物质对其他暗物质的影响方式与普通物质相同"
      },
      {
        "id": "utt-0005",
        "speaker": "SPK_01",
        "start": 50.24,
        "end": 58.376,
        "timing_status": "full",
        "timed_units": 29,
        "untimed_units": 0,
        "text": "大多数现代科研望远镜都是巨型设施 位于大气条件优良的偏远地区"
      },
      {
